# Keep the SMS archive across a settings-preserving sysupgrade, and include it in
# `sysupgrade -b` / LuCI "Generate archive" backups. Both read /lib/upgrade/keep.d/* directly.
# Directory form so any future companion file under it is covered too. This is the whole reason
# the archive lives in /etc and not /tmp or /var: those are tmpfs and wiped every boot.
/etc/h5000m/
